[
  {"comment": "SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT. Convert Mesh's Faceted solid (mitcad#1082) through the OCCT kernel: Body1 (F1, F2) is a plate 40 x 20, 15 thick, with a 10 x 10 window (10500 mm3), written to a binary STL file and read back as the mesh body part (Base1 F3, F3.b0). ConvertMesh1 (F4) welds and merges its triangles into 10 planar faces: a new solid body F4.b0 of the plate's volume, its faces named F4:import(n); the mesh body stays, hidden, so two bodies are shown. Files go to the working directory."},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_rectangle", "sketch": "F1", "corner": [0, 0], "width": 40, "height": 20},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_rectangle", "sketch": "F1", "corner": [10, 5], "width": 10, "height": 10},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "extrude",
    "profiles": [{"sketch": "F1", "region": "r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]}"}],
    "extent": {"type": "distance", "distance": 15}, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"expect": {"body": "Body1", "volume": 10500, "faces": 10}},
  {"cmd": "export", "path": "part.stl", "bodies": ["Body1"]},
  {"cmd": "import_file", "path": "part.stl"},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Base1", "status": "ok", "bodies": 2, "body": "part", "faces": 1, "edges": 0}},

  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "mesh_convert", "body": "F3.b0", "tolerance": 0.01,
    "mode": "faceted", "angle": "0.5 deg"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "ConvertMesh1", "status": "ok", "bodies": 3}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F4.b0", "volume": 10500, "faces": 10, "edges": 24, "min": [0, 0, 0], "max": [40, 20, 15],
    "has_face": "F4:import(0)", "min_face_area": 100}},
  {"expect": {"body": "part", "faces": 1, "edges": 0}},
  {"expect": {"instances": 2, "world_volume": 21000}},

  {"comment": "A torus (F5) written to STL and read back as the mesh body ring (Base2 F6), no prism in any direction: ConvertMesh2 (F7) makes it a faceted solid all the same (F7.b0), one planar face per facet that does not lie in its neighbour's plane, none without area."},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "torus", "plane": "xy", "center": [100, 0], "diameter": 40, "section_diameter": 10,
    "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"cmd": "export", "path": "ring.stl", "bodies": ["F5.b0"]},
  {"cmd": "import_file", "path": "ring.stl"},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Base2", "status": "ok", "body": "ring", "faces": 1, "edges": 0}},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "mesh_convert", "body": "F6.b0", "tolerance": 0.01, "mode": "faceted"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "ConvertMesh2", "status": "ok", "bodies": 6}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F7.b0", "min_face_area": 0.000001}},
  {"expect": {"body": "ring", "faces": 1, "edges": 0}}
]
